&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep proficiency in React and TypeScript.&lt;/p&gt;
